  "title": "Apogee Enterprises Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "MINNEAPOLIS --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 23, 2026-- Apogee Enterprises, Inc. (Nasdaq: APOG) announced today that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.27 per share. The dividend will be payable on May 28, 2026, to shareholders of record at the close of business on May 13,",
